56	## 3. API sources
57	
58	- Bambu: OpenBambuAPI [mqtt.md](https://github.com/Doridian/OpenBambuAPI/blob/main/mqtt.md) and [video.md](https://github.com/Doridian/OpenBambuAPI/blob/main/video.md); ha-bambulab [models.py](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/greghesp/ha-bambulab/main/custom_components/bambu_lab/pybambu/models.py).
